      "content": "it's not just about resting though. i mean, you said i'm a survivor, but what am i surviving for? there's no one left to care for, no one to talk to, no purpose. it just feels like a long, slow descent into nothingness. it feels like the most honest thing to do would be to just... stop. to just let the silence take over completely. does that even make sense?",
